commencement_date:
1/6/2026 P.U. (B) 196/2026 (a) 1 June 2026 as the date on which the Act comes into operation; 
(b) 1 June 2026 to 31 May 2028 as the dates on which the effective period of application of the “First Phase” comes into operation; 
(c) 1 June 2028 to 31 May 2031 as the dates on which the effective period of application of the “Second Phase” comes into operation; and 
(d) 1 June 2031 and onwards as the dates on which the effective period of application of the “Third Phase” comes into operation.
